<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" %>
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CELEBRATE THE WORK</p><h1>Community leaderboard</h1><p>Small contributions add up to meaningful achievements.</p></div></div><div class="info">Score = earned badge points + 10 per currently completed assigned task + 5 per completed project you own. Badges: Project Builder (20), Team Player (15), Task Finisher (25), Conversation Starter (10). Each badge is awarded once.</div><div class="card table-wrap section"><table><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Student</th><th>Badges</th><th>Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach items="${leaders}" var="leader" varStatus="rank"><tr><td>#${rank.count}</td><td><strong><c:out value="${leader.name}"/></strong><c:if test="${leader.id == sessionScope.user.id}"> <span class="tag">You</span></c:if></td><td><c:out value="${leader.badge_count}"/></td><td><strong><c:out value="${leader.score}"/></strong></td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table></div>
